%% 04 — Recommendation Request Flow (Frontend → Backend → ML)
%% See project_review/02_architecture_review.md and 08_recommendation_quality.md.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as Express /api/recommend
    participant ML as FastAPI /recommend
    participant REG as Model Registry
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>FE: select persona (Gamer)
    FE->>API: GET /recommend?user_id=42&persona=Gamer
    API->>DB: fetch customer features
    DB-->>API: row + 3 purchases + wishlist
    API->>ML: POST /recommend {user_features, persona, top_k=10}
    ML->>REG: load booster v0.4.1 (cached)
    ML->>ML: filter candidate pool (250 phones)
    ML->>ML: score via XGBoost + persona weights
    ML->>ML: compute SHAP force values
    ML-->>API: {phones: [...], explanations: [...]}
    API->>DB: INSERT rec_log (user, ranked list, ts)
    API-->>FE: JSON with phones + SHAP reasons
    FE-->>User: cards rendered with "Why this phone?" tooltip
    User->>FE: click phone #3
    FE->>API: POST /feedback {rec_id: 7, action: click}
    API->>DB: UPDATE rec_log SET clicked = phone #3
